---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteData } from '../data/siteData';
---

<Layout
  title={`Education & Research Hub | Moazzam Shoukat`}
  description="Explore Moazzam Shoukat's academic foundation from ITU Lahore and 7 published research papers in speech processing, audio foundation models, and digital healthcare."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-8">
      
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
        ACADEMIC & RESEARCH DIRECTORY
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Education & Research Sections <br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-amber-500 to-amber-600 dark:from-amber-400 dark:to-amber-200 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Are Now Dedicated Pages</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        To provide deeper technical depth and direct access to full papers and degree details, research publications and formal education have been separated into dedicated pages:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-6 text-left">
        <!-- Research Card -->
        <a
          href="/research"
          class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-400 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all group block"
        >
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🔬</div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white group-hover:text-amber-600 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
            Research & Publications &rarr;
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            All 7 peer-reviewed papers in speech transformers, audio foundation models, and acoustic healthcare IoT with direct arXiv & IEEE links.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">
            View 7 Research Papers &rarr;
          </span>
        </a>

        <!-- Education Card -->
        <a
          href="/education"
          class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-400 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all group block"
        >
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🎓</div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white group-hover:text-amber-600 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
            Formal Education & Degrees &rarr;
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Bachelor of Science in Computer Science from ITU Lahore, DAE in Mechanical Diagnostics, and key academic projects.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">
            View Education & Projects &rarr;
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors"
        >
          &larr; Return to Homepage
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
